# Refactor when needed

Refactor when the user asks, when tests or types require it, or when a minimal fix is impossible without a small structural change.

Do not preemptively extract helpers, rename symbols, or restructure modules while you are here.

If a larger refactor would help but is not required, mention it briefly and stay within the requested scope unless the user opts in.
